&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;af6afa1a-1cab-4cca-957d-425d03fab231&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;As a Lead Security Engineer on the Infrastructure Security team, you&#39;ll set the technical direction for how Klaviyo secures its cloud infrastructure and the platforms that deploy it. That spans Google Cloud Platform (GCP) and AWS, delivered through Terraform and Spacelift. You&#39;ll partner across Engineering, Platform, AI/ML and Security to build secure-by-default paved paths and keep our cloud security posture in step with a fast-moving, AI-first company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on technical leadership role. You&#39;ll deliver complex, cross-functional projects end to end, establish the design patterns and standards the team works from, and mentor the engineers around you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Klaviyo, AI fluency isn&#39;t optional; it&#39;s foundational. You&#39;ll lead with AI at every stage of your work, from designing solutions to iterating on implementations, and you&#39;ll take full ownership of the quality and security of what you ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Technologies you&#39;ll guide the team on (not exhaustive)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GCP Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud IAM, Security Command Center, Cloud KMS, Organization Policies, Chronicle Security Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS Security:&lt;/strong&gt; multi-account governance, IAM, KMS, and secure account onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Terraform, Spacelift (stacks, policies, RBAC, drift detection, module registry, private workers), OPA/Rego policy-as-code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source Control and Pipeline Security:&lt;/strong&gt; GitHub organization hardening, GitHub Apps and tokens, CI/CD controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Hardening:&lt;/strong&gt; networks, servers, databases and endpoint protection in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Platform Security:&lt;/strong&gt; securing agent platforms, MCP servers, and the cloud infrastructure behind LLM features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How You Will Make a Difference&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the roadmap and technical standards for infrastructure security across GCP and AWS, and help shape the paved paths and secure-by-default patterns that engineering teams adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead centralized IaC execution: drive Spacelift and Terraform adoption, onboard root modules, and mature drift detection, stack health, and a curated module registry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive GCP governance and lifecycle, including least-privilege IAM, over-permissioned access remediation, project tagging and ownership, secure onboarding, and decommissioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build policy-as-code guardrails (OPA, Organization Policies, CI checks) and roll them out from warn mode to block mode with owning teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harden source control and the delivery pipeline, including GitHub org settings, app and token approvals, and automated security review of infrastructure changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance programs (SOX, HIPAA, SOC 2, ISO) with automated, auditable controls rather than manual evidence gathering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure the infrastructure behind Klaviyo&#39;s AI products, including cloud projects and data boundaries for model and embedding workloads, MCP endpoints, and non-human identities for agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion an AI-first approach to security engineering: design, prototype and iterate with AI tools, build agents and skills that automate recurring control work, and own the review and deployment of AI-generated artifacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decompose complex, multi-team problems into workstreams and set the pace from requirements through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, hold team-wide technical standards, and serve as an escalation point for secure DevOps requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in infrastructure, cloud or security engineering, with demonstrated ownership of cloud security for a production environment at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in the architecture and design of complex enterprise infrastructure solutions, from requirements and design docs through production rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in GCP security and strong working experience in AWS, including IAM design, KMS and multi-account architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Terraform and infrastructure-as-code at scale, including state management, module design and policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with secrets management and non-human identity: service accounts, OIDC, short-lived credentials, key rotation and Vault or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with cloud security tooling such as Wiz, Security Command Center and Chronicle, plus server and database hardening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code (Python, Go or similar) to build automation, integrations and detection or routing logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach every project AI-first: you design with AI, refine with AI, and take full responsibility for validating what you deploy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how agentic AI systems fail: prompt injection, over-privileged tools, shared high-scope credentials, and exposed control planes and MCP endpoints. You know how to apply least privilege and approval gates to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced working through influence and mentoring engineers: you raise the bar for the people around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication: you explain complex designs and tradeoffs clearly to engineers, leaders and non-technical partners across Engineering, Platform and Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spacelift experience, or experience running Terraform through another centralized execution platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Policy-as-code with OPA/Rego, and CI/CD or GitHub organization security experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building or securing AI agents, MCP servers, or AI coding platforms (e.g., Cursor, Vercel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Cloud Professional Cloud Security Engineer or AWS security certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$262,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
